Rear camera autofocus for the OnePlus 7 Pro (guacamole).

Provenance: phone camera-idea HANDOFF.md dated 2026-11-16.
The 0-400 focus range is adapted from hotdog; hardware validation pending.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-rear.dtsi
